// DDGI leak test through a thin (2-voxel, 25 cm) wall. The camera is outside
// the west wall at night; the wall-wash lamp is 0.75 m behind that wall. A
// correct probe visibility leaves the exterior face unchanged, a leak brightens
// it with the DDGI bit on. Compare the two screenshots: mean luminance delta
// below 5% of the exterior face's own luminance passes.
Scenario(
    name: "leak_test",
    scene: Some("testroom"),
    steps: [
        TimeOfDay(hours: 21.5),
        Effects(bits: 2167),
        Camera(pos: (126.0, 1.7, 136.0), yaw: 1.5708, pitch: -0.05),
        Wait(frames: 90),
        Screenshot(name: "leak_on"),
        Effects(bits: 119),
        Wait(frames: 10),
        Screenshot(name: "leak_off"),
        Assert(check: voxel_conservation, tolerance: None),
        Exit,
    ],
)
